{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 152,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9921264648438,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "In summary, the modelling and univariate sensitivity analysis results show that, in Brazil and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.958984375,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "South Africa, use of Diaskintest would potentially save costs per patient and result in greater",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.947998046875,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "health gains (QALYs per patient) compared with the TST and IGRAs. In the United Kingdom,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9800415039062,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Diaskintest results in health gains but is more expensive in terms of expected cost per patient",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.6179809570312,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "than IGRAs. Our results also show that, in Brazil and South Africa, IGRAs are more costly to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9807739257812,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "implement than the TST but would result in health gains. However, in the United Kingdom,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        432.6943359375,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "IGRAs are cheaper to implement and are more cost-effective than the TST.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.6728057861328,
        179.01329040527344,
        204.0528106689453
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.3037109375,
        526.6360473632812,
        227.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "User perspectives on the value, feasibility, usability and acceptability of diagnostic technologies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970861434936523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.8037109375,
        526.9150390625,
        242.94871520996094
      ],
      "text": "are important in the implementation of such technologies. If the perspectives of laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.3037109375,
        526.7977905273438,
        258.44873046875
      ],
      "text": "personnel, clinicians, patients and TB programme personnel are not considered, the technologies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.8037109375,
        456.3227233886719,
        273.94873046875
      ],
      "text": "risk being inaccessible to and underused by those for whom they are intended.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.3076171875,
        512.2666625976562,
        296.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "To address questions related to user perspective, the following activities were undertaken:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.05963134765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        316.20465087890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        303.05963134765625,
        526.9970092773438,
        316.20465087890625
      ],
      "text": "Two systematic reviews, which synthesized the qualitative research evidence on end-user",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        318.55963134765625,
        526.791015625,
        331.70465087890625
      ],
      "text": "values and preferences for the use of specific TBSTs for TB infection, compared with existing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.985790252685547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        334.0596008300781,
        526.9662475585938,
        347.2046203613281
      ],
      "text": "tests (IGRAs and the TST). Study quality and confidence in the evidence were evaluated in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        349.5596008300781,
        271.4122619628906,
        362.7046203613281
      ],
      "text": "accordance with the GRADE-CERQual.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.0596008300781,
        78.81909942626953,
        378.2046203613281
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        365.0596008300781,
        526.63330078125,
        378.2046203613281
      ],
      "text": "Twenty semi-structured interviews with a diverse range of clinicians, laboratory staff,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        380.5596008300781,
        527.1161499023438,
        393.7046203613281
      ],
      "text": "programme officers and individuals living with TB infection (referred to as “consumers”",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        396.0596008300781,
        202.09991455078125,
        409.2046203613281
      ],
      "text": "throughout this report).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.5596008300781,
        78.81909942626953,
        424.7046203613281
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        411.5596008300781,
        527.1734008789062,
        424.7046203613281
      ],
      "text": "A discrete choice experiment (DCE) survey, drawing from themes derived in systematic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        427.0596008300781,
        526.9312133789062,
        440.2046203613281
      ],
      "text": "reviews and semi-structured interviews. DCE methodology was used to elicit stated values",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        442.5596008300781,
        526.99169921875,
        455.7046203613281
      ],
      "text": "and preferences from participants (end-users) without directly asking them to state their",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        458.0596008300781,
        173.8304901123047,
        471.2046203613281
      ],
      "text": "preferred options.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.8982238769531,
        526.9644775390625,
        498.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "Four studies were identified that met the inclusion criteria for both systematic reviews. From",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.3982238769531,
        527.2855834960938,
        513.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "the review on specific TBST, only one data source was identified (from the Russian Federation),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989144325256348,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.898193359375,
        526.9258422851562,
        529.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "and that came from a WHO public call for data relating to the feasibility and acceptability of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.398193359375,
        526.816162109375,
        544.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "TBSTs. Participants were parents of children and adolescents with TB infection. From the review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969608306884766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.898193359375,
        526.9369506835938,
        560.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "on current IGRAs and the TST, three peer-reviewed articles were found to meet the inclusion",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.398193359375,
        526.991943359375,
        575.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "criteria; these three papers were from the Netherlands, South Africa and the United States",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.898193359375,
        527.0140380859375,
        591.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "of America (USA). Participants included a range of health professionals involved in TB care",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.398193359375,
        526.965576171875,
        606.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "(Netherlands, South Africa and USA) and PLHIV (South Africa). The overall confidence in the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.898193359375,
        526.9591064453125,
        622.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "quality of the evidence from the studies was low to moderate based on the GRADE-CERQual",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.398193359375,
        527.0740356445312,
        637.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "assessments, because the data lacked richness, with most studies reporting only summaries of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999000549316406,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.898193359375,
        526.9810791015625,
        653.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "participant quotes or limited direct quotes. All studies were conducted on specific subgroups",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.398193359375,
        407.49395751953125,
        668.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. PLHIV, or parents of children and adolescents with TB infection).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.4022216796875,
        526.9039916992188,
        692.5472412109375
      ],
      "text": "For user interviews, 20 participants were recruited – 13 were TB health care providers (8 from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.9022216796875,
        526.7536010742188,
        708.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "low- and middle-income countries [LMIC]) and seven were people affected by TB (3 from LMIC).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.962586402893066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.4022216796875,
        526.7975463867188,
        723.5472412109375
      ],
      "text": "Health care providers included programme executives and decision-makers, public health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.9022216796875,
        520.3521728515625,
        739.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "practitioners and advocates, physicians, researchers and laboratory technicians, and a nurse.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "136 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}